#% title
# inverse_hilbert_transform

#% text
# `inverse_hilbert_transform(g, s, t)` gives the inverse Hilbert transform, which is `-hilbert_transform(g, s, t)`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
inverse_hilbert_transform(-cos(s), s, t)
#% output
#= sin(t)

#% cell
inverse_hilbert_transform(s/(1 + s^2), s, t)
#% output
#= (1 + t^2)^-1

